{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3e9nMh67GDWuPzqat7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron. The mechanism engages — bolt sliding home with finality.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole narrows to a cold, unwinking eye.\n\nWhat was open is now **closed.**\n\nThe air on either side of me becomes two different worlds.\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}